    "updated_at": "2021-12-07T12:19:32Z",
    "body": "> When would we expect to use \"allow preloads\"? If it's just XHR and `fetch()` I think we have enough state on request to make that determination already.\r\n\r\nCustom headers currently should disallow preloads, but also things like \"synchronous XHR\", which I don't know if we have the knowledge for at this point. ",
